  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the vernier calipers as shown, the instrument has no zero error. What is the length of the rod (in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mm</mi></math>) shown, if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>msd</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>mm</mi></math>? Use <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>msd</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>vsd</mi><mo>.</mo></math><br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0032184_Question.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 84px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "4.5",
  "solution": {
